τος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">83d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">γλῶττα -δεδεμένη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">492b32</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">bind to oneself</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ἀγχόνιον βρόχον κατεδήσατο</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hel.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">687</span> </span> (lyr.); <span class=\"gk\">σπόγγους περὶ τὰ ὦτα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">960b15</span> </span>: metaph., <span class=\"gk\">ἀριθμῷ καταδήσασθαι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">tie up for oneself</b> in lots, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.H.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.3</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">καταδησαμένη τινὰ ὁρκίοις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Parth.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.3</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">b</span> <span class=\"gk\">κ. τι ἀπό</span> or <span class=\"gk\">ἔκ τινος</span>, metaph., <b class=\"lex-tr\">establish securely</b>, <span class=\"gk\">τὴν διὰ πάντων διήκουσαν ὠφέλειαν ἀπὸ</span> [<span class=\"gk\">τοῦ συλλογισμοῦ</span>] <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Procl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">in Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.252</span> </span> C., cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Simp.</span> </span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in de An.</b> <span class=